sion S.A., to the \u201ccut of driver in gun grampa due to alleged failure by vibrations in the E130\u201d of section 66 kV Chimbarongo - Tap Quinta. d.2 Physical phenomenon: OPE23: Factory defect. In this regard, the company CGE Transmission S.A. sent proofs and background in support of the declared physical phenomenon. d.3 Reiteration: Phenomenon Physical reiteration in the affected installation: This installation has not been affected by the same physical phenomenon, during the last 24 mobile month","es":"Estudio para an\u00e1lisis de falla EAF 107/2025\n\u201cFalla en l\u00ednea 66 kV San Fernando - Teno\u201d\nFecha de Emisi\u00f3n: 27-03-2025\n1. Descripci\u00f3n general de la interrupci\u00f3n\na. Fecha y Hora de la falla\nFecha 06/03/2025\nHora 10:55\nConsumos desconectados (MW) 33.20\nDemanda previa del sistema (MW) 10664\nPorcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n 0.312 %\nCalificaci\u00f3n Apag\u00f3n No aplica (porcentaje de desconexi\u00f3n < 10%)\nb. Identificaci\u00f3n instalaci\u00f3n afectada\nNombre de la instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea 66 kV San Fernando - Teno / LT046CI1TR03----T0058 (nemot\u00e9cnico\ncorresponde al tramo 66 kV Chimbarongo - Tap Quinta)\nTipo de instalaci\u00f3n L\u00ednea de transmisi\u00f3n\nTensi\u00f3n nominal 66 kV\nSegmento Transmisi\u00f3n zonal\nPropietario instalaci\u00f3n fallada CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561, piso 17, Las Condes\nc. Identificaci\u00f3n del elemento fallado\nNombre del elemento afectado L\u00ednea 66 kV San Fernando - Teno / LT046CI1TR03----T0058 (nemot\u00e9cnico\ncorresponde al tramo 66 kV Chimbarongo - Tap Quinta)\nPropietario elemento fallado CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A.\nRUT 77.465.741-K\nRepresentante Legal Iv\u00e1n Quezada Escobar\nDirecci\u00f3n Av. Presidente Riesco N\u00b05561, piso 17, Las Condes\nd.1 Origen y causa de la falla\nSe produjo una falla monof\u00e1sica en la fase B de la l\u00ednea 66 kV San Fernando - Teno, despejada a trav\u00e9s\nde la funci\u00f3n de distancia residual en zona 2 desde su extremo San Fernando. Adem\u00e1s, se produjo una\nreconexi\u00f3n autom\u00e1tica sin \u00e9xito por operaci\u00f3n de la funci\u00f3n de cierre contra falla.\nLa causa del evento corresponde, de acuerdo con lo se\u00f1alado por CGE Transmisi\u00f3n S.A., al \u201ccorte de\nconductor en grampa pistola debido a presunta falla por vibraciones en la E130\u201d del tramo 66 kV\nChimbarongo - Tap Quinta.\nd.2 Fen\u00f3meno F\u00edsico:\nOPE23: Defecto de f\u00e1brica.\nAl respecto, la empresa","shown_language":"en","word_scores":[{"w":"failure","s":0.18},{"w":"eaf","s":0.05},{"w":"2025","s":0.14},{"w":"failure","s":0.18},{"w":"66","s":-0.07},{"w":"kv","s":0.24},{"w":"san","s":0.19},{"w":"date","s":-0.06},{"w":"description","s":-0.03},{"w":"date","s":-0.06},{"w":"time","s":-0.25},{"w":"failure","s":0.18},{"w":"date","s":-0.06},{"w":"06","s":0.07},{"w":"03","s":0.37},{"w":"2025","s":0.14},{"w":"time","s":-0.25},{"w":"10","s":0.02},{"w":"consumptions","s":-0.16},{"w":"mw","s":0.18},{"w":"20","s":0.15},{"w":"prior","s":-0.03},{"w":"mw","s":0.18},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.08},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.08},{"w":"percentage","s":-0.08},{"w":"disconnection","s":0.08},{"w":"10","s":0.02}]},"predictions":{"conflux":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.9878,"breaker_fault":0.0087,"transformer_fault":0.0026,"busbar_fault":0.0009},"confidence":0.9878,"correct":true},"quorum":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.6655,"breaker_fault":0.1153,"transformer_fault":0.1531,"busbar_fault":0.0661},"confidence":0.6655,"correct":true},"nexus":{"pred":"line_fault","display_pred":"LINE FAULT","probs":{"line_fault":0.6155,"breaker_fault":0.1724,"transformer_fault":0.109,"busbar_fault":0.1031},"confidence":0.6155,"correct":true}},"explanations":{"conflux":{"method":"Exact Shapley (Modality) + Gradient Attribution (Within-M